## Adaptation note (ECareHome edition)

This is a localized fork of the original "Use Case Writer" skill by Phúc NT ·
BA Zone · Digital School. The fork retains the original methodology unchanged
and modifies only: (1) output language rule — English-only → Vietnamese-first
bilingual, to match the ECareHome `ech-docs` repo convention; (2) worked
examples — EdTech / Digital School domain → ECareHome home-service domain.

All authorship and attribution to Phúc NT / BA Zone / Digital School is
preserved per the Attribution requirement above.
